03 = Disconnecting
04 = Connecting
05 = Idle
06 = Configuring
07 = Available

While the Device State Model is not to be edited, there are situations where a disconnect command is required, specifically when 
module is being programmatically inhibited / uninhibited if a device supports operating in a 'virtualized' capacity.  In this case, the rung containing the disconnect command
can be conditioned to not issue a disconnect command when operating in a 'virtual' capacity with the module disconnected

]]>
</LocalizedComment>
</Comment>
